(7482543, 1190326, 100393, '<td valign="top">I recognise that tibial plateau fracture! And the bipartite patella.</td>', 'I recognise that tibial plateau fracture! And the bipartite patella.', '2016-11-14 17:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482556, 1190491, 124815, '<td valign="top">The most endearing image<br/>bump</td>', 'The most endearing imagebump', '2016-11-14 21:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482568, 1190463, 117474, '<td valign="top">i have a very particular definition for what a conjunction is, and this has come from my work. i didn''t expect to see my vision of conjunctions here, but here we have it. it''s geometry, reflection, depth. many worlds in one. the multiverse. not so much a meeting place of things, but a union of things together in harmony or otherwise.</td>', 'i have a very particular definition for what a conjunction is, and this has come from my work. i didn''t expect to see my vision of conjunctions here, but here we have it. it''s geometry, reflection, depth. many worlds in one. the multiverse. not so much a meeting place of things, but a union of things together in harmony or otherwise.', '2016-11-14 23:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482570, 1190414, 117474, '<td valign="top">this is a complexity of storylines. love it!</td>', 'this is a complexity of storylines. love it!', '2016-11-14 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482669, 1190452, 98565, '<td valign="top">you had a good idea for conjunction, the grapefruit looks juicy but it is somewhat "static" and the white area on the left is too dominant for my taste</td>', 'you had a good idea for conjunction, the grapefruit looks juicy but it is somewhat "static" and the white area on the left is too dominant for my taste', '2016-11-15 11:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482671, 1190580, 98565, '<td valign="top">you achieved that almost everything in this picture is shiny, I like that. The conjunctions is very clear also - nice!</td>', 'you achieved that almost everything in this picture is shiny, I like that. The conjunctions is very clear also - nice!', '2016-11-15 11:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482677, 1190360, 98565, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the new word partyer (didn''t know that so far)<br/>What''s bothering me in this picture is that there is a lack of concentration or closeness, I can''t see the faces and some seem to be really interesting. A restriction to half of the people without those on the balcony would have helped imo. I have to admit, that it would have been difficult to get the balloons into the frame also. Well, situations fly by while photog has to react and you certainly wanted to get most of the party into the picture, so as a remeberance for bride and groom(?) this is perfect</td>', 'I like the idea and the new word partyer (didn''t know that so far)What''s bothering me in this picture is that there is a lack of concentration or closeness, I can''t see the faces and some seem to be really interesting. A restriction to half of the people without those on the balcony would have helped imo. I have to admit, that it would have been difficult to get the balloons into the frame also. Well, situations fly by while photog has to react and you certainly wanted to get most of the party into the picture, so as a remeberance for bride and groom(?) this is perfect', '2016-11-15 11:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482679, 1190522, 98565, '<td valign="top">oh wow, this is so fragile</td>', 'oh wow, this is so fragile', '2016-11-15 11:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482685, 1190564, 98565, '<td valign="top">Usually I''m no fan of colourkey, but this one is quite different because of the reflection. Still I think it''s not beneficial for the picture that only part of the lettering "DINER" is to be seen</td>', 'Usually I''m no fan of colourkey, but this one is quite different because of the reflection. Still I think it''s not beneficial for the picture that only part of the lettering "DINER" is to be seen', '2016-11-15 11:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482690, 1190597, 182284, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! 10</td>', 'Brilliant! 10', '2016-11-15 11:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
