(7482694, 1190326, 98565, '<td valign="top">hmm I don''t know what to think about this - the knee - a perfect conjunction. The doctor doing his work - as interesting motif, a good idea to bring these together in one shot. But what is drawing most of my attention is the black cable dangling there in the background without being plucked in. <br/>Well thinking of it: this is a missing conjunction! OH YES - now I''ve got it! 8 from me</td>', 'hmm I don''t know what to think about this - the knee - a perfect conjunction. The doctor doing his work - as interesting motif, a good idea to bring these together in one shot. But what is drawing most of my attention is the black cable dangling there in the background without being plucked in. Well thinking of it: this is a missing conjunction! OH YES - now I''ve got it! 8 from me', '2016-11-15 11:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
