(7482734, 1190463, 140305, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at - it seems there''s a city in there somewhere among several levels of reflections - but whatever it is, I like it. A lot.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at - it seems there''s a city in there somewhere among several levels of reflections - but whatever it is, I like it. A lot.', '2016-11-15 13:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482735, 1190548, 140305, '<td valign="top">Wow! not the typical sunset by the shore photo. Love it!</td>', 'Wow! not the typical sunset by the shore photo. Love it!', '2016-11-15 13:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482736, 1190326, 140305, '<td valign="top">Georges? I hope these belong to you and it means you''re healing well!</td>', 'Georges? I hope these belong to you and it means you''re healing well!', '2016-11-15 13:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482748, 1190039, 98565, '<td valign="top">I can see Australia. I don''t understand the conjunction. But this is not bothering me, sometimes I''m somewhat slow on the uptake and others see it at once. <br/>What is bothering me is that the colours have a purple cast that seems to be unnatural</td>', 'I can see Australia. I don''t understand the conjunction. But this is not bothering me, sometimes I''m somewhat slow on the uptake and others see it at once. What is bothering me is that the colours have a purple cast that seems to be unnatural', '2016-11-15 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482749, 1190509, 98565, '<td valign="top">This is going to ribbon, I''m sure! The classical, easiest, most beautiful conjunction, perfectly candid shot. Was it really candid or setup? No matter, this deserves top scores and as is often the case I''m wondering why I didn''t have that brilliant idea</td>', 'This is going to ribbon, I''m sure! The classical, easiest, most beautiful conjunction, perfectly candid shot. Was it really candid or setup? No matter, this deserves top scores and as is often the case I''m wondering why I didn''t have that brilliant idea', '2016-11-15 15:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482852, 1190552, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, however the yellow marker is sharp and the blue is slightly out of focus. They look to be in the same plane so my eye is bothered by it. I like the bright colors and the inverse colors in the background.</td>', 'I like the concept, however the yellow marker is sharp and the blue is slightly out of focus. They look to be in the same plane so my eye is bothered by it. I like the bright colors and the inverse colors in the background.', '2016-11-16 15:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482853, 1190566, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the color and composition but the soft edges didn''t work for me.</td>', 'I like the color and composition but the soft edges didn''t work for me.', '2016-11-16 15:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482896, 1190483, 102315, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot just wish it had a bit more sharpness.</td>', 'Really cool shot just wish it had a bit more sharpness.', '2016-11-16 20:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482897, 1190451, 102315, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition and the overlay you used.</td>', 'I really like your composition and the overlay you used.', '2016-11-16 20:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482898, 1190414, 102315, '<td valign="top">I really like this image and feel it tells a story yet I do not know what that story is. The car is very distracting though. It''s the catch 22 of street photography. You can''t compose every shot perfectly. Good job in general.</td>', 'I really like this image and feel it tells a story yet I do not know what that story is. The car is very distracting though. It''s the catch 22 of street photography. You can''t compose every shot perfectly. Good job in general.', '2016-11-16 20:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482900, 1190509, 102315, '<td valign="top">Seems set up. Sorry if it''s not but the set up feeling pulls me out of an otherwise great image. Still not giving a lower score but it would be higher if I didn''t get the staged feeling from it.</td>', 'Seems set up. Sorry if it''s not but the set up feeling pulls me out of an otherwise great image. Still not giving a lower score but it would be higher if I didn''t get the staged feeling from it.', '2016-11-16 20:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482902, 1190556, 102315, '<td valign="top">The everyday. pretty cool but not extremely interesting and a little drab for my taste.</td>', 'The everyday. pretty cool but not extremely interesting and a little drab for my taste.', '2016-11-16 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482904, 1190326, 102315, '<td valign="top">Different and interesting.</td>', 'Different and interesting.', '2016-11-16 20:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482905, 1190360, 102315, '<td valign="top">Focus is way too soft.</td>', 'Focus is way too soft.', '2016-11-16 20:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482907, 1190580, 102315, '<td valign="top">Sharp image with a good black and white treatment. I like it even though it''s not an extremely interesting image.</td>', 'Sharp image with a good black and white treatment. I like it even though it''s not an extremely interesting image.', '2016-11-16 20:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482908, 1190463, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very artistic. A good shot.</td>', 'Very artistic. A good shot.', '2016-11-16 20:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482909, 1190133, 102315, '<td valign="top">Great colors and sharpness just not as grand an angle or crop.</td>', 'Great colors and sharpness just not as grand an angle or crop.', '2016-11-16 20:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482910, 1190407, 102315, '<td valign="top">I like the color treatment but am not Wowed by the subject.</td>', 'I like the color treatment but am not Wowed by the subject.', '2016-11-16 20:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482911, 1190564, 102315, '<td valign="top">Perfect selective saturation which is too often over or under down by many including yours truly. Only critique for me is that I would have removed teh "ER" from the top which I think is now allowed in standard editing. I keep wanting to look at it. The reflection in the car window is a unique and nice touch for sure!!</td>', 'Perfect selective saturation which is too often over or under down by many including yours truly. Only critique for me is that I would have removed teh "ER" from the top which I think is now allowed in standard editing. I keep wanting to look at it. The reflection in the car window is a unique and nice touch for sure!!', '2016-11-16 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482912, 1190039, 102315, '<td valign="top">I''m partial to drone shots which this seems to be.</td>', 'I''m partial to drone shots which this seems to be.', '2016-11-16 20:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482913, 1190440, 102315, '<td valign="top">what a capture. I would love a private message on how and where you captured this.</td>', 'what a capture. I would love a private message on how and where you captured this.', '2016-11-16 20:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482950, 1190483, 24744, '<td valign="top">The image is overall a little too soft.</td>', 'The image is overall a little too soft.', '2016-11-17 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482952, 1190562, 24744, '<td valign="top">This looks very blurry, not much is in focus, background is cluttered and the flat desaturation and overdone noise reduction don''t add much either.</td>', 'This looks very blurry, not much is in focus, background is cluttered and the flat desaturation and overdone noise reduction don''t add much either.', '2016-11-17 15:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482953, 1190326, 24744, '<td valign="top">the strange halo around the guy''s face doesn''t help the image.</td>', 'the strange halo around the guy''s face doesn''t help the image.', '2016-11-17 15:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482954, 1190556, 24744, '<td valign="top">I like the title; unfortunately the image itself doesn''t really say conjunctions to me, and I find the background a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the title; unfortunately the image itself doesn''t really say conjunctions to me, and I find the background a little distracting.', '2016-11-17 15:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482955, 1190552, 24744, '<td valign="top">Blue is out of focus, which torpedoes an otherwise strong composition.</td>', 'Blue is out of focus, which torpedoes an otherwise strong composition.', '2016-11-17 15:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482956, 1190586, 24744, '<td valign="top">Too little of the cocktail stick is in focus, too much clutter in the background, and why on earth would you put ice IN a martini??</td>', 'Too little of the cocktail stick is in focus, too much clutter in the background, and why on earth would you put ice IN a martini??', '2016-11-17 15:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482957, 1190596, 24744, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the blown out highlights detract from the image and the bird''s wing gets lost against the background.  Overall it feels as if it''s lacking in resolution - as if the resolving power of the lens used here isn''t up to the task, or there''s a bit of camera shake, and it''s been sharpened to compensate a bit too heavily.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the blown out highlights detract from the image and the bird''s wing gets lost against the background.  Overall it feels as if it''s lacking in resolution - as if the resolving power of the lens used here isn''t up to the task, or there''s a bit of camera shake, and it''s been sharpened to compensate a bit too heavily.', '2016-11-17 15:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482958, 1190564, 24744, '<td valign="top">the edges of your desaturation selection, especially around the redm seem a little sloppy and inconsistent - it lets down an otherwise strong effect.</td>', 'the edges of your desaturation selection, especially around the redm seem a little sloppy and inconsistent - it lets down an otherwise strong effect.', '2016-11-17 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482959, 1190360, 24744, '<td valign="top">Overall image quality seems poor, like excessive noise reduction has been applied - especially on the balloons.</td>', 'Overall image quality seems poor, like excessive noise reduction has been applied - especially on the balloons.', '2016-11-17 15:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482960, 1190440, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good drama and dynamism, but I can''t help feeling it would have been improved if at least some part of the image weren''t motion blurred.</td>', 'Good drama and dynamism, but I can''t help feeling it would have been improved if at least some part of the image weren''t motion blurred.', '2016-11-17 15:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482961, 1190451, 24744, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t say "conjunctions" to me at all.</td>', 'This doesn''t say "conjunctions" to me at all.', '2016-11-17 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482962, 1190566, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but the dark out of focus area on the far right is a little too strong, pushing the composition out of balance.</td>', 'Nice colours but the dark out of focus area on the far right is a little too strong, pushing the composition out of balance.', '2016-11-17 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482963, 1190573, 24744, '<td valign="top">A wide angle composition like this would have worked better if the verticals were exactly vertical.</td>', 'A wide angle composition like this would have worked better if the verticals were exactly vertical.', '2016-11-17 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482964, 1190491, 24744, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened, especially excessive sharpening artefacts on the fur.</td>', 'Oversharpened, especially excessive sharpening artefacts on the fur.', '2016-11-17 16:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482965, 1190597, 24744, '<td valign="top">A desaturation that used colour filters to increase the contrast between the path and the foliage would have improved this image, rather than what looks like a flat desat here.  The fence in the foreground being slightly out of focus is a bit distracting, I would have tried to get that sharp perhaps at the expense of the further background.</td>', 'A desaturation that used colour filters to increase the contrast between the path and the foliage would have improved this image, rather than what looks like a flat desat here.  The fence in the foreground being slightly out of focus is a bit distracting, I would have tried to get that sharp perhaps at the expense of the further background.', '2016-11-17 16:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482966, 1190039, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good composition and interesting perspective (drone, presumably?) but I don''t really see "conjunctions" in this.</td>', 'Good composition and interesting perspective (drone, presumably?) but I don''t really see "conjunctions" in this.', '2016-11-17 16:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482967, 1190489, 24744, '<td valign="top">The composition is uncomfortable, and the background too cluttered.  The flat desat does not help the image.</td>', 'The composition is uncomfortable, and the background too cluttered.  The flat desat does not help the image.', '2016-11-17 16:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482968, 1190522, 24744, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition, and good tones.</td>', 'Very strong composition, and good tones.', '2016-11-17 16:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482969, 1190517, 24744, '<td valign="top">Classic, strong composition and good colours.</td>', 'Classic, strong composition and good colours.', '2016-11-17 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482970, 1190407, 24744, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but I''m not a fan of the excessive tonemap.</td>', 'Interesting subject but I''m not a fan of the excessive tonemap.', '2016-11-17 16:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
