(7483370, 1190451, 104230, '<td valign="top">Back to bump for the second time. Each time I view this I appreciate it some more. Good use of added texture, and nice leading lines to the face that''s the focus.<br/>I''m aware of feeling sadness in response to this, especially in response to seeing the poppies all so neatly placed.  When I was a child we would attend Remembrance day services on Plymouth Hoe, with the Army, Navy, Air Force, and Marines all very well represented, along with wounded veterans. This, of course, in a city that was very badly bombed during the war.</td>', 'Back to bump for the second time. Each time I view this I appreciate it some more. Good use of added texture, and nice leading lines to the face that''s the focus.I''m aware of feeling sadness in response to this, especially in response to seeing the poppies all so neatly placed.  When I was a child we would attend Remembrance day services on Plymouth Hoe, with the Army, Navy, Air Force, and Marines all very well represented, along with wounded veterans. This, of course, in a city that was very badly bombed during the war.', '2016-11-20 23:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
