(7483427, 1190452, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that fully meets the challenge<br/> <br/>A great idea Marcel and well executed too. I like your composition it works well, the grapefruit looks delicious. I like also that you have used a wooden utensil it has so much more interesting character than plastic or metal, the wood grain and the way the juices are soaking into the wood work really well. Your lighting is good, the focus and DOF are good too. I dont have a problem with the white background its neutrality enables us to focus all our attention on the main subject. Another excellent entry Marcel, well done, keep up the good work.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that fully meets the challenge A great idea Marcel and well executed too. I like your composition it works well, the grapefruit looks delicious. I like also that you have used a wooden utensil it has so much more interesting character than plastic or metal, the wood grain and the way the juices are soaking into the wood work really well. Your lighting is good, the focus and DOF are good too. I dont have a problem with the white background its neutrality enables us to focus all our attention on the main subject. Another excellent entry Marcel, well done, keep up the good work.', '2016-11-21 08:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483428, 1190553, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that fully meets the challenge<br/> <br/>An excellent interpretation of the challenge brief, the processing has worked well to give a much more convincing result than a lot of HDR Ive seen in the past. I like the speeding boat and its watery wake the diagonal works really well in terms of its position and binding that portion of the image together. The sky is adorable and I actually like the darkness of the left of the frame, its distinctive shapes work well in terms of the overall image. Another great entry Eugene, well done</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that fully meets the challenge An excellent interpretation of the challenge brief, the processing has worked well to give a much more convincing result than a lot of HDR Ive seen in the past. I like the speeding boat and its watery wake the diagonal works really well in terms of its position and binding that portion of the image together. The sky is adorable and I actually like the darkness of the left of the frame, its distinctive shapes work well in terms of the overall image. Another great entry Eugene, well done', '2016-11-21 08:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
